Because of war, national division leads to our nation being shattered and weakened. We have been waiting for 57 years, from the inauguration of the National Olympic Stadium, we have a new stadium and a football table, which we have nicknamed "Techo Heritage National Stadium" and "Stadium Palace".
The achievement that the Cambodian people jointly inaugurated under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, is a great and great achievement.
This achievement is not a dream achievement, but an achievement that truly symbolizes after our long-awaited desire.
This achievement brings great joy and pride on behalf of us as a nation that has been weakened by the crisis of war. About 20,000 monks, national leaders, government officials, the armed forces, youth and students who were invited to the inauguration ceremony on December 18, 2021, all showed their smiles.
On the afternoon of the inauguration day, with the permission of the visit, many Cambodians in Phnom Penh visited to take a photo as a souvenir with a face full of smiles. This smile is a sign of welcome and great joy for the presence of the stadium.
There are many factors that lead to the emergence of a great and full of great achievements of the Cambodian nation. In that, the peace that Cambodia has fully achieved for more than two decades under the win-win policy of Samdech Techo is the main precondition. After that is the ambition of the head of the Royal Government, Samdech Techo Sen, and the entire Cambodian nation, who are hungry and have deep ambitions to achieve the sport, which represents world peace.
In addition, the Cambodian-Chinese diplomatic policy initiated by Samdech Norodom Sihanouk and the previous generation of leaders in a joint relationship to protect the sovereignty from the oppression of the big country, turned into a steel alliance today has become an important driving force for a historic achievement. This. The stadium was built with Chinese aid of $ 150 million, a huge grant.
Wang Yi, China's top adviser and foreign minister, said the construction of the stadium was an unprecedented amount of aid to China.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that the presence of the stadium shows the unparalleled generosity of China.
In addition, the strong will and conscience of Chinese experts, a total of 820 workers and workers worked together to overcome the difficulties, including the 19 epidemic of Kovid. Although Kovid 19 disrupted activities, the storm of desire for a modern stadium took shape, Kovid 19 could not interrupt construction activities. Finally, this magnificent construction was completed as planned, taking 48 months to build.
Therefore, peace, political leadership, diplomacy and the ambition of national prestige have pushed Cambodia to achieve this historic new achievement.
Palace Stadium is one of the most famous stadiums in the region and the world. Therefore, this achievement brings back the national pride and prestige for the Cambodian nation that was lost due to the conflict, national division and war in the past.
With only 11 days left, the 23rd anniversary of the achievement of peace, unity and complete unity in Cambodian society (December 29, 1998 - December 29, 2021). The achievements of the Stadium Monument, which was inaugurated today, seem to remind the Cambodian people that peace is valuable and necessary to bring about great achievements for the nation that need to be kept together. Can neglect anyone to come to the rescue.
Long live peace, long live the great achievements of the Cambodian nation "Stadium Stadium of Moradok Techo Stadium".
