Crowds visit stadium stadium
(Phnom Penh): After the official inauguration, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, also allowed people to visit the stadium on the afternoon of December 18, 2021.
Many people visit the stadium as a family. Some families visit and relax inside the building and then return home, but families also sit and watch the fireworks at night.
The people who visited were very happy and proud of the presence of this spacious international standard stadium.
They were amazed at the efforts that led to the construction of the stadium.
It should be noted that the stadium in the Techo Heritage National Stadium was officially inaugurated this morning, December 18, 2021 under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Mr. Wang Vinthean, Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia. . The inauguration of this historic achievement was attended by about 20,000 people.
The stadium is built on an area of 86,000 square meters and can accommodate 60,000 spectators at a cost of $ 150 million with a grant from the Chinese government. The construction employs 270 Chinese workers and 550 Cambodian workers.
In technical terms, the stadium is equipped with the latest technology in accordance with international sports standards, which can help Cambodia to be more able to organize sports events as well as tourism events with: 4 LED screens (3 inside 3 outside 1 ) There are shops, exhibition halls, 34 hotel rooms and 17 VIP rooms for watching sports.
In addition, this magnificent stadium is built to a high standard of safety, that is, can evacuate 60,000 people from the stadium in case of eventual risk in just 7 minutes. The stadium has 54 gates for access to sports, 93 bathrooms, 863 toilets.
