In front of the diplomats of many countries, along with more than 10,000 participants and many live broadcasts, Samdech Techo Hun Sen affirmed that the achievements of the Techo National Heritage Stadium that Cambodia received from China Steel. This does not extend to the depth of the heart of the Chinese government and people provided to Cambodia from the beginning until now.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "Today we have achieved this great achievement, but I think something even greater that can not be measured is the depth of morale that the Chinese leaders, the Chinese people Provided for the people of Cambodia. "Today is a great achievement, but what is even bigger is the spirit that our friends have given us to strengthen the socio-economic development while strengthening the independence and sovereignty of Cambodia."
In addition, the Head of the Royal Government of Cambodia also expressed his deep gratitude to the People's Republic for providing a grant for this magnificent building. Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed his pride that this stadium is a fruitful achievement in the relations between the People's Republic of China and Cambodia.
According to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Chinese Steel Friends handed over what is available today is not a coincidence and lack of communication, that is, Cambodia-China has strived to build relations between the two countries based on Mutual trust, mutual respect, solidarity with each other. Political trust, respect for each other's independence and sovereignty have been the strongest foundations of the Sangkum Reastr Niyum era until now.
The Prime Minister stressed that these are the foundations on which we are building a comprehensive strategic partnership, and now Chinese President Xi Jinping has named the Cambodia-China friend "Steel Friendship". Which no one can break.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen, who strives to maintain and strengthen the relationship between Cambodia and China after Samdech Norodom Sihanouk, said that the assistance of the People's Republic of China is not only meant for socio-economic development, but also Help strengthen the independence of Cambodia's political sovereignty.
Samdech Techo also expressed hope that there would be no other pressure aimed at imposing sanctions on Cambodia, as only Cambodia was free to communicate with the People's Republic of China.
Please be reminded that regarding the pressure or sanctions from the United States on Cambodia, Mr. Wang Winthean, Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia, during the groundbreaking ceremony for the actual shooting range at the Phnom Chum Reak Reay Military Police Training Center on the 17th. December reaffirmed that the Chinese government continues to strongly oppose US pressure on Cambodia to attack the close Cambodian-Chinese relationship.
China's reaction comes after the United States recently unveiled its sanctions on the Royal Government of Cambodia, declaring that it would not sell arms to Cambodia, accusing the Royal Government of violating human rights and having close ties with China. .
With condemnation of arbitrary unilateral sanctions, Wang Winthean considered that the United States has been continuously painting the Royal Government of Cambodia, especially on the relationship between Cambodia and China, a comprehensive strategic partner and friend. Steel.
According to the Chinese ambassador, the relations and cooperation between China and Cambodia have gone through many experiences and will remain strong, and the two armies will support each other, promote practical cooperation and enhance all-round cooperation. As a strategic partner in all aspects and as a community with a common destiny.
