The Stadium Monument is the largest of the buildings in the Techo Heritage National Stadium in Sangkat Prek Ta Sek, Khan Chroy Changva, Phnom Penh. The construction site of the stadium was inaugurated under the presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen on April 4, 2017. The stadium received about $ 160 million in construction grants from the Chinese government.
