Please be informed that hosting the ASEAN Summit in 2022 is the third task for Cambodia to host this important regional summit and summit after becoming Became a member of ASEAN on April 30, 1999. Hosted the first time in 2002 and the second time in 2012.
The Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen has emphasized that as the chair of ASEAN in 2022, Cambodia will lead the joint efforts of ASEAN to achieve more important achievements. In particular, promote the momentum of the process of building an ASEAN community that is equitable, strong and environmentally in line with the core spirit of ASEAN is a vision, an identity, and a community.
