The French Ambassador emphasized that in the future, the Secretary-General of the International Organization of Francophonie will visit Cambodia, which is an important opportunity to strengthen cooperation between the Cambodian Parliament.
Mr. Jacques Perle informed the President of the National Assembly that France will continue to cooperate and provide development assistance to Cambodia in the future.
