He noted that the 16th Annual International Conference on "New Context of ASEAN-ROK Relations" has made significant contributions to the promotion of researchers, politicians, organizers and policymakers, as well as other stakeholders. The people of ASEAN and the Republic of Korea should love each other more, protect, strengthen and continue to cultivate this friendly relationship for the benefit of both nations.
