Cambodian Red Cross Branch in Siem Reap Provides CRC Youth Towels to 162 Students
(Siem Reap): On December 16, 2021, the Cambodian Red Cross branch in Siem Reap province donated 162 CRC youth handkerchiefs to 162 students from Hun Sen Damdek High School, Sot Nikum District, Chikreng High School and Svay Leu District High School, Siem Reap Province.
