Mr. Theam Sam An stated that the Cambodian Red Cross, headed by Samdech Katiprit Bun Rany Hun Sen, has always taken care of the well-being of the people in all circumstances and everywhere, regardless of political affiliation, race or color. Any color, like the word where there is difficulty, there is the Cambodian Red Cross.
In addition, the Chairman of the Sub-Branch Committee would like to call on all people to be more careful, please continue to strictly implement the measures of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister "3 protect and 3 do not". To help prevent and prevent the spread of Kovid 19, be extremely careful of all new viruses.
With the campaign to prevent the spread of Kovid-19, Mr. Them Sam An also called on all uncles and aunts to be careful of fires that may be caused by fire, stove, incense, candles, especially electrical problems. Be careful not to be negligent.
According to Ms. Sin Ratana, Deputy District Governor, the humanitarian donations provided to each family include: 10 kg of rice, 10 packets of noodles, 1 packet of salt, 1 packet of mask, 2 cans of fish, 1 can of condensed milk and 1 packet of tea. Samdech Techo Hun Sen: ASEAN Has Two Mistakes in Resolving Problems with Myanmar
(Phnom Penh): Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen has said that ASEAN has made two mistakes in resolving issues with Myanmar.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said this in the morning meeting of the Council of Ministers on December 16, 2021. Samdech Techo Hun Sen's remarks were quoted publicly on the Facebook page by Minister of Information Khieu Kanharith.
According to the Minister of Information, the two mistakes of ASEAN in resolving the issue with Myanmar mentioned by Samdech Techo Hun Sen are: First, ASEAN has set preconditions to send its representatives to work with the Myanmar authorities and Second, when attending the ASEAN Summit, the invitation letter was not sent directly to the Myanmar Head of State, but to the Secretary-General of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Myanmar.
During this morning's cabinet meeting, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed concern over ASEAN's bad habits regarding the convening of ASEAN members, as in the case of Myanmar.
The speech of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, quoted by the Minister of Information, reads as follows: "The word ASEAN is 10, we can not get 9 ASEAN. If we accept ASEAN in the next 9 days, there will be 8 ASEAN and then 7 in a row, because the convening of the ASEAN Summit is the decision of the annual chair, not a validation mechanism like the United Nations. Therefore, if the president does not like any country, he can not invite.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen is using a compromise to enable Myanmar, which is experiencing a political crisis, to rejoin the ASEAN Summit when Cambodia hosts in 2022, while Myanmar will not be able to attend the 2021 ASEAN Summit. Do not join.
For Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Myanmar's absence from the ASEAN Summit is in violation of the ASEAN Charter and the principle of consensus on ASEAN decisions.
In order to solve the problem of ASEAN by bringing Myanmar back to the ASEAN Forum, Samdech Techo Hun Sen will pay a visit to Myanmar on January 7 and 8, 2022. Samdech Techo Hun Sen also appointed Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs, as the President of ASEAN to solve the problems of Myanmar.
At the inauguration ceremony of Chip Mong's Hyatt Hotel on December 15, 2021, Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked analysts not to blame Cambodia and to allow Cambodia to solve Myanmar's problems first. Digital Online
