(Kampong Cham): Mr. Nol Ny, Deputy Director of the Conservation Office of the Kampong Cham Provincial Department of Environment, was arrested by the Kampong Cham Provincial Gendarmerie on charges of "breach of trust by the Governor or other staff" and remanded in custody. 26 days and until December 16, 2021.
According to the police, in connection with the arrest of an environmental official named Nol Ny, starting from the accused and his wife, Sem Sophea, a resident of Tuol Khpos village, Krouch commune, Prey Chhor district, Kampong Cham province, co-founded a company with the other party during 2017.
Then, in 2020, the company will receive nearly $ 50,000 for the US concrete road project. However, prior to the disbursement day, Sem Sophea and Nolny changed the company's joint account number to Sem Sophea's personal account and told the cashier to transfer the check back into their personal account and open Take that money and take it away without giving the other party information.
As for the money that Nolny and his wife embezzled, it was the company's money that had not been deducted from expenses such as: sand, stone, cement, steel, labor and interest ... and other expenses. That is why the other party has filed a lawsuit for legal action.
