A: Adherence to the leadership of the party. Political parties, one of the fundamental organizations of the nation's political life, have played an important role in political leadership. If a country is considered a political machine, a political party is the head machine and a facilitator of that machine. Only under the leadership of a political party can the development of a country be in the right direction.
B: Adherence to the people. We understand that a political party can only give up any of its special interests, does not represent the interests of any group of interests of any power group or of any privilege, adhere to the people and rely on the people to be Maintain success.
D: Adherence to independence and ownership. In the history of humankind, no nation or nation has been able to achieve strength and resilience based on external forces, copying foreign models and emulating them. A political party can only lead the nation forward if it adheres to independence and self-determination.
E: Adherence to the Chinese path. The direction determines the path and the path determines the destiny. Although there are thousands of routes available, it is a good one. Only by creating our own path based on reality can we walk smoother and wider, otherwise we will go the wrong way. Therefore, any political party must adhere to respect the real situation of the nation and find and create the right path that is consistent with the reality of their country.
G: Adherence to pioneering and innovation. Innovation is a driving force for development for a country and a nation. The bigger the task, the more difficult it is to overcome, the more difficult it is to pioneer and innovate. Only a brave, innovative party can walk the path that previous generations have never been able to create more unimaginable miracles.
H: Adherence to the courage to fight. All the achievements of each political party in leading the country are not accidental, nor are they the gifts of anyone, they are the result of constant fighting. No matter how strong the enemy, no matter how difficult the path, no matter how great the challenge, only if you are not afraid of sacrificing your life, you will not be afraid of defeat, you will be brave, you will fight and you will be able to overcome all obstacles and risks.
Standing: Adhere to the striker union. Unity is a force. A strong political party unites as a united force, uses all the positive factors that can be used to promote the harmony of political party relations, ethnic relations, religious relations, class relations and national relations, both inside and outside the country, and a large gathering of collective strength. Most recently, he was able to succeed in leading the party and the sector in the country.
N: Adhere to dare to make a revolution for yourself. The progress and purity of a party is not innate, it is born out of constant self-revolution. Only by daring to remove all the factors that destroy the progress and purity of the party, clean up all the viruses that affect the well-being of the party can ensure long-term development without changing the quality, do not change the color and do not change the smell.
(Phnom Penh): The Royal Academy of Cambodia is organizing an international conference on "New Context of ASEAN-Republic of Korea Relations" for two days from December 16 to 17, 2021 at the Royal Academy of Cambodia. The conference is conducted in person and via video.
The opening ceremony was presided over by Dr. Bin Chin, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister in Charge of the Office of the Council of Ministers, Mr. Park Ing-kyung, Ambassador of the Republic of Korea to Cambodia, Dr. Sok Touch, President of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, and Dr. Park Ing Jail, President of the Victory Institute for Higher Education of the Republic of Korea, as well as leaders of the Royal Academy and some experts.
The Republic of Korea joined ASEAN in 1989 as a sectoral dialogue partner. Since then, ASEAN and the Republic of Korea have cooperated in the multilateral field, covering the three pillars of the ASEAN Community. In particular, the ASEAN-Korea Free Trade Agreement (AKFTA) was signed in 2009.
ASEAN-ROK relations were upgraded to a strategic partnership in 2010. The Embassy of the Republic of Korea was established in Jakarta, where the ASEAN Secretariat was located, in October 2012. The mission is responsible for promoting ASEAN-Korea relations and deepening their cooperation.
Since 2019, ASEAN has been the second largest trading partner of the ASEAN Republic and a destination for foreign direct investment. For ASEAN, Korea is the fifth largest trading partner.
