In addition, Dr. Kun Nhem continued that when the crackdown will suffer taxes and fines, but if you volunteer to pay taxes from January 1 to June 30, 2022 is to suspend the tax. VAT only.
Dr. Kun Nhem said that the delay of 3 months or 4 months is a period to allow those who are conscious of fulfilling their tax obligations in accordance with the law of the country to enter easily without any restrictions. No compulsion.
The General Department of Customs has decided to reduce the tax by 10% and temporarily suspend the crackdown on duty-free vehicles under various license plates until December 31, 2021 to allow time for vehicle owners to hurry to fulfill their tax and duty obligations. The law is in force.
