The bilateral meeting was held during the official visit of a high-level inter-institutional delegation of the Russian Federation to the Kingdom of Cambodia for three days from December 14-16, 2021.
The purpose of the visit is to strengthen the ties of solidarity and bilateral cooperation between the two countries, and in particular between the two countries' institutions and institutions in the fields of military and military technology, justice of the two countries, as well as relations and security. International news.
At the meeting, the two countries' leaders exchanged views on recent developments in the Asia-Pacific region and issues that threaten regional and global security.
The two sides agreed to strengthen cooperation in the fight against terrorism, combating illegal drug smuggling, transnational crime, fighting the color revolution, and cooperating in the fight against money laundering and necessary terrorist financing. We must work together to prevent and respond in a timely manner to ensure regional and global peace and stability.
At the same time, the Cambodian side also shared Cambodia's experience on the movement to create a color revolution and measures to prevent the color revolution, which was previously designed to overthrow the legitimate Royal Government.
