The event was held at the CRC branch office in Kandal province in the presence of Ms. Men Neary Sopheak, First Deputy Secretary General of the Cambodian Red Cross and Permanent Vice President of the National Elite Working Group, Dr. Mao Phirun, Honorary President and Mr. Kong Sophorn, President. Kandal Provincial Branch of the Cambodian Red Cross.
On that occasion, Ms. Men Neary Sopheak brought the words of Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, who sent a message of deep sympathy to all the people and the entire forum.
At the same time, she expressed her deep gratitude to the Honorary Committee of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch in Kandal Province and the philanthropists from all walks of life who have always supported the operators, officers, staff, youth and volunteers of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch in Kandal Province for humanitarian activities. Like the early rain.
Speaking on this forum, she brought the six appeals of Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen on the occasion of World AIDS Day to our compatriots to participate in the implementation for the welfare of families and society, as well as call To the private sector, philanthropists from all walks of life, please continue the partnership and continue to support the Cambodian Red Cross to contribute with the Royal Government to achieve the goal of zero in 2025.
