The intention to seek a solution from the top leader of the Royal Government of Cambodia has also been criticized by some analysts, who allege that Samdech Techo Hun Sen wanted to work with the coup plotters. Former Thai Foreign Minister Kasit Phirum has come out strongly against the intention to reunite ASEAN by Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
