(Prey Veng): Mr. Kim Vanna, Deputy Chairman of the CPP Working Group in Pearang District, Prey Veng Province, and Chairman of the CPP Working Group in Kampong Popil Commune, today recognized 52 new members of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) in Kampong Popil Commune, Pearang District, Prey Veng Province. There were 39 women on December 12.
