(Phnom Penh): The Department of Environment of Phnom Penh, on the afternoon of December 13, 2021, held a training course on the implementation of the transitional penalty mechanism for the offenses set out in Chapter 7 of the Sub-Decree on Urban Solid Waste Management. In Daun Penh district to disseminate to all 11 communes in Daun Penh district.
