The two countries signed a joint statement on the resumption of diplomatic relations between the People's Republic of China and the Republic of Nicaragua, a Chinese Foreign Ministry spokesman announced on Friday.
According to the joint statement, the two governments have agreed to re-establish friendly relations between their two countries based on the principles of mutual respect for sovereignty and territorial integrity, non-aggression. , Do not interfere in each other's internal affairs, provide equality, benefit each other and live together in peace.
