Certainly, I have nothing to do with the party. But I, my children, as well as the people of Cambodia as a whole, will greatly benefit from the arrangement of the successors of mature political parties to this leadership by maintaining stability, peace, prosperity and progress. An essential prerequisite for life.
A strong family leader brings a peaceful and prosperous family. It is even more important for the nation to select national leaders who are capable of both knowledge and leadership, as well as have a conscientious will for the nation, the motherland and the people to serve as a stepping stone to a common goal of national prosperity and continue. Build national prestige.
According to the party leader and the man of the state who saved and built the Cambodian nation, it shows a very careful consideration in arranging successors to preserve the legacy of the next generation. Before building hard for more than half a century (for the next 10 years) and bring achievements and create a new legacy to move forward.
Therefore, the refinement and selection of the successors of the Cambodian People's Party is really important and the highest value for the nation and the people of Cambodia to continue to stand with dignity on this planet.
I sincerely hope and believe that the successors will continue to work hard to implement their heroic example, spirit, will, conscience, bring happiness, prosperity and prestige to their nation and people.
