General knowledge: In addition to the Great Wall and the Great Canal, China has another great ancient architecture.
From the completion of the construction of the Tou Jiangyuan Dam until now, the land in Chengdu has been transformed from a degraded land into a fertile land from a famine-stricken land to a fertile land. The amazing thing is that it is over 2,000 years old, but the construction remains strong for a long time. Moreover, it has also made great social and economic development. The reservoir can irrigate up to 5,300 square kilometers of agricultural land.
Please be informed that in 2000, the ancient architecture of "Tu Jiangyuan" was included as a UNESCO World Heritage Site and attracted the attention of tourists from around the world. The present is widely known. ”
Source: Chinese Culture Book "Landscape and Architecture"
