(Phnom Penh): Mr. Osman Hassan, Senior Minister in charge of Special Mission, on the afternoon of December 7, 2021, led a delegation to pay homage to the body of Prince Norodom Ranariddh at the morgue at Samdech Panh Street, Sangkat Panh. Boeung Reang, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh.
