According to the planned program of the cremation, there were two groups of Samdech Preah Moha Sangkha Reach (2 Samdech Preah Aphitham), 8 monks and 67 monks, a total of 77 monks. 38 monks of the Mahanikaya, 39 monks of the Dhammayutnikaya, 39 monks of the Sattabakarna Pitham (genealogy).
During the mourning ceremony, the Royal Government set the flag to be flown at half-mast in public and private institutions.
Radio, television and other media are prohibited from playing entertainment programs. In the entertainment club, karaoke bar is also suspended.
