(Phnom Penh): Following the recommendations of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Prof. Mam Bunheng, Minister of Health, together with Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh, and with the participation of Dr. Yok Sambath, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health and Technical Working Group On December 7, 2021, both of them inspected the construction site of Kovid-19 Medical Center in Sangkat Kork Rokar, Khan Prek Pnov, Phnom Penh.
