Kampong Thom Provincial Governor Instructs Citizens to Maintain Land Titles to Guarantee Land Ownership
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Governor of Kampong Thom Province, instructed the people to keep the land title to guarantee the right to own or occupy the land.
Mr. Nguon Rattanak said so at the handing over ceremony of 575 families equal to 1,273 vouchers in Veal Pring Krom village, Chheu Teal commune, Sandan district, Kampong Thom province on December 6, 2021.
Mr. Nguon Rattanak congratulated the people who received the land title at this time and requested that they work hard to maintain the title deed properly and safely.
"This title deed is very meaningful and very important for us landowners to secure the right to own or occupy the land." According to the provincial governor.
He added that land registration is very important, which can reduce disputes and ensure the safety of land from fraud by some crooks.
The people living in Chheuteal commune, Sandan district, are very happy to receive the title now and thank Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, together with the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning, Construction and Cadastral Affairs. Developing partners who have taken care to support the smooth process of land registration in this system and get a solid plan.
