Samdech Krom Preah was born on January 2, 1944. Son of King Norodom Sihanouk and concubine Phat Kanoul, a royal courtier. Samdech Krom Preah has five sons and daughters, including: Prince Norodom Chakravuth, Princess Norodom Siharith, Princess Norodom Ratana Devi, Princess Norodom Sothearith and Princess Norodom Ranavong.
