Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the Inauguration Ceremony of National Road 11 and Prey Veng City Road worth Nearly 100 Million USD
(Phnom Penh): National Road No. 11 connecting Neak Leung to National Road No. 7 in Tbong Khmum District, Tbong Khmum Province and nearly 100 kilometers of roads in Prey Veng City at a cost of nearly 100 million US dollars has been completed and inaugurated. To be used this morning, December 6, 2021.
The inauguration ceremony of National Road 11 and Prey Veng City Road was presided over by the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia Wang Vinthean. On the occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen made the following important remarks:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is really proud of the achievements of National Road 11.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that the construction project of National Road No. 11 was signed to borrow about 106 million US dollars during his visit to China between 14 and 17 May 2017.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that National Road 11 serves the transportation in the province and connects with other provinces, including the ASEAN highway connection.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen sends a message from the Chinese Ambassador to thank Chinese President Xi Jinping for his continued support for Cambodia's infrastructure development, which has so far helped build more than 3,000 kilometers of roads and bridges.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is unfortunate that Kovid 19 came to destroy the Cambodian national budget. Why did Samdech immediately announce the construction of the road construction project connecting Lvea Em district to National Road No. 11?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although Cambodia was in a difficult situation due to Kovid 19, however, the social assistance program could not be eliminated and there could be more education with a focus on the elderly.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he did not allow any citizen to die of starvation. This declaration of commitment was issued on January 14, 1985, the day Samdech received the support of the President of the Council of State.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that Samdech is a candidate who received 100% support from the National Assembly to be the Chairman of the State Council, unlike previous candidates.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the well-being of the people must be taken into account, which has been one of his policies since he was elected Chairman of the State Council in 1985.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on the people, especially the elderly, not to lose their lives due to the cold weather.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that some private sector 19 Kovid Hospital buildings should be returned to their owners.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech had recommended the construction of 19 large Kovid Patient Treatment Centers and several emergency departments.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Techo Heritage Stadium will be officially inaugurated on December 18. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the inauguration day of the Techo Heritage National Stadium will be attended by more than 10,000 people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the budget must be managed very carefully to prevent any risk caused by Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Chinese friends and highly appreciated the efforts of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, Prey Veng Provincial Authority and relevant authorities, as well as the people who cooperated to complete the construction of Road 11.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the other three major projects that Cambodia has to build include: the bridge across the Mekong River in Kratie, the road connecting Stong district to Kratie province and the bridge over the Tonle Sap River connecting Kampong Chhnang and Kampong Thom.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is also studying the road connecting Battambang and Siem Reap. Samdech Techo confirmed that these projects to connect the road network in Cambodia so that people can move forward without going back.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech was a person who was very famous because of Pol Pot and the tripartite and was published by Thai newspaper, Bangkok Post and The Nation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen hopes to see the presence of Khmer prawn food on the Chinese table. Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered that the import of trout from China will provide more opportunities for trout farmers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that after the establishment of 19 Kovid vaccines in Cambodia will make Cambodia worry about finding vaccines.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed and issued an order to immediately check and provide the third dose of vaccine to the people at the border.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that those who insulted Samdech may have had a family who died of Kovid 19 and had to be cremated at the location arranged by Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reacts to remarks made by Ngov Sunchean, Commander of the Vietnamese Border Guard, at a press conference in Ho Chi Minh City to prevent the spread of Kovid 19 from Cambodia. Samdech Techo stated that Samdech could not accept this statement. Samdech Techo questioned whether the current Kovid 19 outbreak in Vietnam was a sin.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reacts and does not accept the statement of the Vietnamese border commander who said that Cambodia is the source that led to the transmission of 19 Kovid virus to Vietnam
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the remarks of the Vietnamese border commander caused a great deal of pain for Samdech. Samdech Techo confirmed that Samdech is not against Vietnam, but the words of this Vietnamese army commander are an insult to the Cambodian people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the words of the Vietnamese border commander were to make Samdech use in vaccinating the Cambodian people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked the Vietnamese border commander should apologize to Samdech Techo and the Cambodian people? Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants to see the Vietnamese Undersecretary of Defense correct his statement that Cambodia was the source of imports of Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had asked the Vietnamese government to remove the border commander, but the government had removed him from the border to become Vietnam's deputy defense minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that after the free trade agreement between Cambodia and China entered into force in January 2022, it will improve the breath of the Cambodian economy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the announcement of support for Hun Manet as the future Prime Minister candidate has two meanings. The first meaning is one of the candidates. Therefore, candidates in other parties want to compete is to apply. The second meaning is to emphasize the democratic process through elections, not through other means.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the preparation for the Prime Minister of the Cambodian People's Party is four lines.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that Samdech was the one who urged Samdech Chea Sim to be the President of the Cambodian People's Party.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the three sons served as Samdech's secretaries. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has 10 intellectuals around him. But the detainee, who was often called to church, had three sons.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that another prime ministerial candidate who had been set aside also came out in support of Hun Manet.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen released seven groups of people to survey the demand for coffee around the speech of Samdech supporting Mr. Hun Manet as the candidate for Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech will pay his respects to the late King Father Norodom Ranariddh and will also pay his last respects on the day of cremation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns the opposition not to spend time learning about the Cambodian People's Party, but to try to help its opposition party.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he spoke with the Indonesian Foreign Minister at a meeting on December 1 that the effectiveness of China's vaccine had reduced the number of 19 cases of Kovid.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on the people to adhere to the measures "3 protection and 3 do not" to prevent the spread of Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Techo Heritage National Stadium is a gift from the Chinese President to the Royal Government, Samdech and the Cambodian people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the Cambodian People's Party, many people can afford to be the Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech holds the position of Prime Minister equally, at least equal to Samdech Ponhea Yat, who reigned for 43 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on the Cambodian people to rise up and fight against Kovid 19 not to be looked down upon.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterated that he would go to Myanmar to talk with Ming Oung Lang.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that ASEAN member countries must not go beyond the ASEAN Charter by interfering in the internal affairs of member countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is a new member, but the old member is not sure because there is a new leader. In particular, new members are not new because there are old leaders.
