It should be noted that the food provided to 150 families affected by Kovid 19 is: rice, noodles, salt, fish, fish sauce, cooking oil and blankets. Mr. Moeung Son was arrested by the military and sent back to court for breach of trust in a case of land purchase in Kulen district, Preah Vihear province
(Preah Vihear): A woman has filed a complaint with the Preah Vihear Provincial Prosecutor's Office against Moeung Son, known as the director of the Foundation for the Support of Khmer Civilization, for breach of trust and breach of contract in a land purchase and sale case in Srayong Tbong village, Preah Vihear province. Srayong, Kulen District, Preah Vihear Province.
After the court issued an arrest warrant, the Preah Vihear Provincial Armed Forces, in cooperation with the Siem Reap Provincial Armed Forces, arrested Mr. Moeung Son and sent him to the Preah Vihear Provincial Prosecutor's Office, but after questioning, he was allowed to return.
Plaintiff Toun Chantrea, 50, described buying five plots of land measuring 158,231 square meters from Moeung Son for $ 100,000 and handing over the first deposit of $ 37,000 to him. Moeung Son will pay another $ 35,000 to the bank and settle some of the expenses with the landkeeper for Mr. Moeung Son to avoid any problems.
The plaintiff stated that he had to pay Mr. Moeung Son more money to cover the land price and to have Mr. Moeung Son transfer the land title to him on April 30, 2021. However, on April 27, 2021, Mr. Moeung Son avoided receiving money to cover the price of the land and gave his thumbprints to transfer ownership to him. His name is Toun Chantrea.
After receiving the complaint, the Preah Vihear Provincial Prosecutor's Office summoned Mr. Moeung Son for questioning, but Mr. Moeung Son did not respond to the summons three times, so the prosecutor issued an arrest warrant on the 29th. November 2021.
In order to implement the court order effectively, the Preah Vihear Provincial Gendarmerie, in cooperation with the Siem Reap Provincial Gendarmerie, on December 1, 2021, brought Mr. Moeung Son to the Provincial Prosecutor's Office for questioning but could not. He was detained, which upset the plaintiff and called on the Ministry of Justice and its leaders to seek justice for him.
Regarding this accusation, Mr. Moeung Son could not ask for clarification on December 5, 2021.
