The body of Samdech Krom Preah Norodom Ranariddh, Chairman of the Supreme Council of the King and President of FUNCINPEC will arrive in Cambodia from France on December 5, 2021 tomorrow. This is according to Mr. Nhoeun Raden, the spokesman of FUNCINPEC party, confirmed to Fresh News.
After arriving in Cambodia, the body of King Norodom Ranariddh will be laid to rest at the Royal Palace on Samdech Panh Boeung Reang Street, Daun Penh District, Phnom Penh to celebrate the religious festival.
It should be noted that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, on December 2, 2021, issued a decision to establish a committee to organize the funeral of Norodom Ranariddh. The commission is comprised of 28 members, chaired by King Kong Sam Ol, Minister of the Royal Palace.
