5: Please take care of the elderly and children, do not let them play in the water or alone, lest drowning eventually.
At the same time, the Chairman of Kampong Thom Provincial Branch Committee thanked Samdech Kittiprit Bun Rany Hun Sen for always taking into account the difficulties of the poor people without leaving anyone, no matter where they are.
