(Pursat): A group of thieves snatched wallets from two victims in the center of Pursat City while driving, causing serious and minor injuries to one person, and then took the phone and some equipment to escape.
This incident happened at 8:45 AM on December 3, 2021 at the point on National Road 5 in Thnal Bapek Village, Sangkat Roleap, Pursat City, Pursat Province.
Sources from the police said that at the time of the incident, there was one case of burglary of a wallet caused by two unidentified suspects riding an orange motorbike with no license plate. Seizing the wallets of two victims who were riding a motorcycle, causing one serious injury and one minor injury.
