(Phnom Penh): The National University of Management of Veal Sbov this morning, December 3, 2021, organized a groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of a school building with 15 classrooms to expand the training of students to have specific skills. The ceremony was presided over by Dr. Hang Chuon Naron, Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, with the participation of officials at all levels of the Ministry of Education.
Speaking on the occasion, Mr. Ly Sokheng, Vice Rector of the National University of Management of Veal Sbov, said that the development of this university has started for many months, with an area of 6 hectares, 9 meters wide and 50 meters long, we have received funding. From the Ministry of Economy and Finance in charge of this construction.
He said the project to build the new building took more than a year and could be completed by February 2023. This location is an additional location of the National University of Management, located in the center of Phnom Penh, and this location is also an initiative of Mr. Hang Chuon Naron, Minister of Education, Youth and Sports to the National University of Management.
The Vice Chancellor highlighted the development of the National University of Management, citing the Faculty of Digital Economics. This college has 3 majors including: 1: Digital Economy 2: Financial Technology 3: Urban Development Management. Each year, the university recruits 30 students per subject.
He stated that studying at the university is done without any political tendencies, so that all students can show their ability to help the people and the motherland.
