Police Arrest Murderer in Siem Reap City, Takhmao City, Kandal Province
(Kandal): In just 24 hours, a man stabbed his wife to death in Siem Reap City, Siem Reap Province, was successfully separated by the Criminal Police Force after arresting her husband at the Preah Noray roundabout in Takhmao City, Kandal Province. At 2:30 on December 3, 2021.
The murder happened at 1:00 pm on December 2, 2021 yesterday at a rented room in Taksin Tbong Village, Kork Chak Sangkat, Siem Reap City, Siem Reap Province, causing a victim named So Chanthy, 38 years old. Died in a pool of blood after her husband stabbed her in the throat with a sharp knife.
He added that the operation was carried out under the direct command of General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner General, Lt. Gen. In Bora, Deputy Commissioner General of Planning and directly pointed out by Lt. Gen. Neng Chuor, Director of the Criminal Police Department. The operation was led by Major General Cheav Vibol, Deputy Director of the Department, in cooperation with the Kandal and Siem Reap Provincial Police.
After the arrest, the perpetrator was sent to the Criminal Police Department for questioning and further proceedings.
