Many international media published the news that Samdech Techo Hun Sen announced his support for Hun Manet as the future Prime Minister.
(Phnom Penh): In addition to the local press, many international media around the world have published stories related to the story of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the current Prime Minister of Cambodia, announcing his support for his son, Hun Manet, as the candidate for Prime Minister of Cambodia. In the future.
Please be informed that on the occasion that Samdech Techo Prime Minister Hun Sen officially inaugurated the 37 roads in Sihanoukville on the morning of December 2, 2021, Samdech Techo announced his full support for Mr. Hun Manet Son Samdech's eldest son continues to be the Prime Minister, but must go through an election.
Samdech added that the future leader after Samdech is Mr. Hun Manet, one of the candidates for the Prime Minister, and this candidate is not the only one, but Mr. Hun Manet has the full support of Samdech.
Following the announcement, national and international media published a series of announcements.
