(Phnom Penh): Khmer Civilization Expert Mr. Rath Sandab expressed his congratulations and deep gratitude to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, for explaining the meaning of the nickname "Love Tree and Love Stone". Along the boulevard, cross from Ream beach to Otres beach, Sihanoukville province.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen explained that "the tree of love and the stone of love" is a symbol of immortality to the existence of independence, sovereignty, the existence of peace, the permanence of the constitutional monarchy and the throne.
Mr. Rath Sandab confirmed that this title is really dedicated and gives the best value to the descendants of Kol Thida Khmer love for their homeland forever. This means that the tree of love and the stone of love that Samdech Techo named this is a tree and stone that has a history and a clear meaning that makes the Khmer people inside and outside the kingdom in this modern day very proud. Most.
Mr. Rath Sandab said that if so, the meaning and value of the tree of love and the stone of love, which represents the survival of peace, not to lose, protect independence, national sovereignty, monarchy and protect everything. In hand until now, especially as recently as Samdech Techo inaugurated many new roads and water filters worth millions of dollars.
Under the meaning of "Love Tree and Love Stone" is associated with the Khmer belief system since ancient times in the sense of a blessing or a curse, because the ancient Khmer ancestors when building or inaugurating national achievements are always inscribed as Blessings and curses in the sense that tell the next generation that whoever protects this achievement will go to heaven, but whoever destroys will go to hell until the moon and sun are gone.
Thus, the Love Tree and the Love Stone represent the stability, peace, and protection of all that exists today, in the sense that whoever maintains these peace or other achievements will be blessed to ascend to heaven. On the other hand, whoever destroys peace is going to hell until the moon and sun are gone.
At the same time, it also reflects two meanings:
First, the literal meaning for peacekeepers and all the achievements that have been made is to be blessed by the angels forever. Second: The literal meaning for those who wish to destroy peace and wait to lead the country is to wait. Forever like that.
Mr. Rath Sandab confirmed that the tree of love on the boulevard passes from Ream beach to Otres beach and the stone of love with a large rock along the road when traveling up the hill. Under Sihanoukville, this is a historic location in this modern kingdom. In other words, if they come to this place, it makes them feel immediately, "Oh! We have arrived at the peaceful location of our kingdom. ”
