Experts expect Siem Reap real estate to explode after reopening tourism
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Keo Sotheara, Executive Director of KW Siem Reap Branch, expressed his strong expectation that the real estate sector in this large world tourist destination will explode after the reopening of tourism based on many potentials, especially Remodeling by building a lot of infrastructure today.
This confirmation was made during the signing ceremony of the agreement to install KW Siem Reap from the sub-branch to the branch of KW Cambodia in the presence of Duke Dr. Kim Heang on December 2. This optimism is based on the leadership of the Royal Government after the announcement of the reopening of the country, accompanied by the exemption of licenses for foreign travelers and preparations for the upcoming vaccination tour for Siem Reap.
"Siem Reap is ready with the construction of 38 roads, which will be completed by the end of this year, the redesign of Siem Reap, the new airport, which will be completed by 2023," he said. So Siem Reap is waiting for only one thing, tourism, because Siem Reap is a big tourist province. Thus, after Siem Reap can receive foreign investors and international tourists, it is clear that the real estate sector will grow very much.
In particular, Dr. Kim Heang expressed the same optimism after the return of tourists in Siem Reap, not only boost the economy, as well as provide employment opportunities for people through the needs of all sectors, but also promote the real estate sector. In this province as well.
