(Phnom Penh): Members of the Association of the Elderly in Poverty in Chroy Changvar District, Phnom Penh, received a gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross.
