Draft Law on Finance for 2022 Management Passes Senate
(Phnom Penh): The draft law on finance for management in 2022, prepared by the Royal Government, passed the Senate on December 2, 2021.
This draft law was reviewed and unanimously approved by the Senate by 54 votes of the total number of senators.
On December 2, 2021, the Senate of Cambodia held an extraordinary meeting. The fourth legislature was presided over by Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate, with the participation of 54 senators in the following order:
* First: Review and comment on the draft law on finance for management in 2022. * Second: Review and comment on the draft law on the payment of the general state budget for management in 2020. * Third: Review and comment on the draft law on the approval of the ASEAN Protocol on Strengthening Dispute Resolution Mechanisms.
