The Deputy Governor continued that the first project is to repair a concrete road, 0.15 meters thick, 82 meters long, 8 meters wide, with an area of 656 square meters, located in Kraol Kor village, Sangkat Kilometer 6.
The second project is to repair and install a sewer system with a diameter of 0.80 meters and a length of 400 meters in Phsar Touch village, Chong Khsach village, Sangkat Toul Sangke I, and to restore two sewers with a diameter of 0.8 meters and the first line with a length of 940 meters And repairing 12 more drainage wells in Phsar Touch village, Sangkat Toul Sangke I and the second line with a length of 580 meters in Samaki village, Russey Keo commune.
