* Indicator 3: To develop health qualifications in each target is to have a hospital, laboratory, have the means to treat in case of infection. He said that in Sihanoukville, as well as in Phnom Penh and Siem Reap is doing well.
* Indicator 4: In each safe tourism destination, the private sector must be prepared to receive tourists, including whether all business establishments are qualified to receive tourists or not. In fact, all business people in Sihanoukville are 100% vaccinated.
