Ministry of Labor will delay the application for permission to use foreign labor until the end of January 2022
The ministry has found that some factory owners or directors are still late in applying for foreign labor permits (quotas) for 2022.
In such a situation, the Ministry of Labor informed the owner or director of the factory that the Ministry has postponed the application for a foreign labor permit (quota) for 2022 until the end of January 2022.
The Ministry has reminded the owners or directors of factories that need to use foreign labor for 2022 to apply for a permit to use foreign labor (quota) before January 31, 2022. Failure to apply for a permit will result in disciplinary action in accordance with Chapter 16 of the Labor Law.
