7 cross-border motorcycle smugglers arrested, confiscated a car and 18 motorcycles in Banteay Meanchey province
(Banteay Meanchey): Cambodian and Thai law enforcement forces have made efforts to prevent cross-border crimes of all kinds that can occur through corridors along the border, but the crime of smuggling goods still occurs.
