According to a report by Fresh News, when the police patrolled, they found a group of smugglers on a motorcycle crossing the border into Cambodia, so the police chased and arrested two people and three motorcycles while they They tried to run away from the authorities through the potato fields.
Immediately, the police increased their force by searching around the area before arresting 5 more people, confiscating 15 more motorcycles and 1 car, a total of 7 people (3 males, 4 females).
