Please be informed that Samdech Krom Preah Norodom Ranariddh passed away at the age of 77 in France on November 28, 2021 due to illness.
Samdech Krom Preah Norodom Ranariddh was born on January 2, 1944 in Phnom Penh. He was the eldest son of King Norodom Sihanouk and concubine Phat Kanol. Samdech Krom Preah was the first Prime Minister in the first term from 1993 to 1997 and served as the President of the National Assembly from 1998 to 2006.
