Therefore, what is effective for the Information Office and the spokesperson is related to the subject matter that needs to be communicated with all relevant departments, including the selection of a Deputy Provincial Governor who can meet regularly with the Provincial Governor and the officials. Another provincial hall, because all documents must be entered through the same entry and exit. This is what the Minister said.
