(Phnom Penh): Prof. Mam Bunheng, Minister of Health, presided over the opening ceremony of the consultation meeting on the draft Health Strategic Plan 2022-2030 via video system, which was attended by the leadership of the Ministry of Health and the central unit. 80 people.
