(Phnom Penh): At the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces Headquarters on the morning of November 30, 2021, Lt. Gen. Hun Manet, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF), met with Ms. Teo Lay Cheng. Entered the position of Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary of the Republic of Singapore to the Kingdom of Cambodia in early 2021.
