Taking this opportunity, the Prime Minister, Deputy Prime Minister and Ambassador of Japan also discussed mechanisms for the rehabilitation and development of various sectors after the decline of Kovid-19, especially the rehabilitation and promotion of investment in Cambodia, etc.
