(Banteay Meanchey): Pursuant to the order of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, the Governor of Banteay Meanchey Province, Mr. Ou Rathrey, has set a plan for the joint police force to prepare for the operation to crack down on those who come to encroach on land in the flooded forest area in the province. .
Preparations for the operation took place in a meeting on November 29, 2021 in the presence of Mr. Ou Rath, Provincial Governor, Provincial Gendarmerie Commander, Provincial Police Commissioner, Provincial Deputy Commander, Commander of the 51st Infantry Brigade, District Governor. Relevant departments, relevant units around the province.
After receiving the order, Brigadier General Born Bin, Commander of the Banteay Meanchey Provincial Gendarmerie, led 219 armed forces to crack down on those who came to encroach on the flooded forest area in the province.
Brigadier General Born Bin said that the team inspected the clearing of the criminals who stole and flooded the flooded forest land in two districts, Mongkul Borei and Preah Net Preah districts, and decided to confiscate the land in these two districts and keep it. Leave it as state property.
Brigadier General Born Bin said that in these two districts, all the flooded forests are home to spawning fish, but they have been cleared by corrupt people and corrupt officials to take over all the flooded forest lands to farm.
He said that the team has researched in these two districts, if any crooks see the clearing and encroachment on the flooded forest land, the working group will confiscate all the land and plant the flooded forest trees as state property according to the order of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and General Sao Sokha, Commander of the National Armed Forces.
At the same time, during the low tide, the joint team will not allow the corrupt Jin Kil, who has occupied the flooded forest land, to cultivate the land on the above land, and require the local authorities and professional officials to make a big sign to put it on. On the site to be confiscated, the above land should not be destroyed further. The team will continue to search for the identity of the perpetrators to build a case to be sent to court for legal action.
Joint Securities Regulator of Cambodia and ADB jointly raise awareness of green bond issuance process
(Phnom Penh): The Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia, in collaboration with the Asian Development Bank (ADB), under the ASEAN Bond Market Initiative (ABMI), with support from the Government of Japan Climate Investment Facilitation Fund and the Reduction Fund. Poverty and Regional Cooperation of the People's Republic of China Hosts Online Workshop on "Developing Emerging East Asia Sustainable Bond Market"
The workshop aims to raise awareness of sustainable finances as well as build capacity for issuers, financial advisors, underwriters and other market participants and to explain the process of Issue a green card. (Green bond refers to a bond issued by a company that raises that source of capital to invest in a business that helps the environment without harming the environment).
This workshop program is organized into 3 sessions, including: 1) Sustainable Certificate Issuance, focusing on the case study of Green Card Issuance, 2) Green Certificate Certification, and Review and Evaluation of Green Bonds by Independent Assessors and Session 3) Discussions focusing on ecosystems, regulations and practices related to policies for the development of a sustainable bond market.
