Taxes: Today is the last day to pay taxes on means of transportation and all types of vehicles in 2021, after this day, vehicle owners can still pay taxes, but have to pay double tax
Please be informed that the tax on means of transportation and all kinds of vehicles is a tax that must be paid annually and the tax collection must be carried out from June 1 to November 30 of each year.
Even if the deadline expires on November 30, vehicle owners will still be able to pay the tax, but will have to pay a double tax. This is according to a senior official of the General Department of Taxation.
In addition, from January 1, 2022, the General Department of Taxation and in cooperation with the authorities will inspect this tax declaration and fine for any means of transportation and vehicles that do not declare tax properly. And on time.
