Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, on the occasion of inspecting the OWSO in Kien Svay district, Kandal province, said, "We are now examining the possibility of any other services under the district authority that can be placed at the port. One exit, we will strive. "If the OWSO does not do well, there is another office called the Complaints Office or the Citizens' Office, he has the right to file a complaint."
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng said that so far, the OWSOs in Phnom Penh, Kandal, Kampong Cham and Battambang provinces have been fully operational in all districts, and other provinces have not yet been fully operational, but will continue. Launched continuously to improve the provision of public services to the people.
(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of November 29, 2021, Chamkar Mon Hall held a workshop on integration of three-year rolling investment program in Khan-Sangkat 2022-2024 in the presence of Mr. Kim Chandina, Director of Phnom Penh Capital Planning Department, Mrs. Keo Samol, Deputy Governor of Chamkar Mon District. Prum Samkhan, Chairman of Khan Council, Mr. and Mrs. Deputy Governor, as well as Chiefs of 5 communes, relevant departments and partner organizations and philanthropists.
