Ms. Keo Samol stated that the projects to be submitted for support in the integration workshop in 2021 for implementation in 2022 have 110 priority activities of the district administration, including 22 economic projects, 50 social projects, 27 projects for land management, natural resources, environment and 11 projects for administrative and security services.
