CPP Central Committee Mass Movement Meets with Central Committee of the Communist Party of Vietnam
(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of November 29, 2021, Ms. Men Sam An, Chairman of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP), met with Ms. Bui Thi Minh Hai, Chairman of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of Vietnam (CPP) to discuss ties. Friendship, bilateral cooperation and future direction of cooperation between the two parties via video.
During the meeting, Ms. Men Sam An expressed her pleasure to meet with Ms. Bui Thi Minh Hai and congratulate her on her election as Party Secretary and Chairman of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of Vietnam. This new mandate.
Ms. Men Sam An expressed her warm congratulations on the glorious success of the 13th General Assembly of the Communist Party of Vietnam, which set out key tasks and strategies for leading the country in the next five years. He wished Vietnam to achieve its goal of "becoming a high-income developed country by 2045."
At a time when the world is under serious threat from Kovid-19, leaders within both the party and the government are stepping up and deepening ties through a series of video and live phone conversations. Raise to greet and support each other, both materially and spiritually, for the common good of both countries and peoples.
The two sides exchanged information on the emerging situation of each party and country, especially the good experiences and effective mechanisms in the stages of the spread of Kovid 19 and the direction of enhancing cooperation between the party and the country. Both countries for the benefit of the people of both countries.
Out of this online meeting, both sides praised the fruitful results in implementing the spirit of the summit and the agreement between the two parties, including scholarship programs, high-level exchanges, high-level professional delegations People and coordination of health services for people in border provinces and Cambodian students studying in Vietnam.
At the end of the afternoon meeting, the two sides expressed satisfaction over the fruitful results that have contributed significantly to the traditional friendship, strong solidarity, good neighborliness and the strengthening of close cooperation. Between the ruling party and the people of the two countries for the mutual benefit of the people of the two countries.
