3: Request companies and partner organizations (UNIDO & SDC) to cooperate with the specialized department of the General Department of Technical and Vocational Education and Training to study the needs of skilled workers in the installation, maintenance and repair of elevators in Cambodia to prepare a training plan to respond. And labor market needs.
5: All trainers must pay attention to learn both theory and practice effectively and with quality and must ensure occupational safety rules during the internship.
