(Phnom Penh): Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, and his wife, as well as the staff and civil servants of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, are deeply saddened by the passing of President Norodom Ranariddh. FUNCINPEC Party and Chairman of the Supreme Council of the King.
