According to the estimates of the General Department of Customs and Excise in Cambodia, there are duty-free left-hand drive and right-hand drive vehicles that take refuge under various license plates such as Cambodian license plates, state license plates, civil license plates and civilian license plates, as well as tourist cars. There are about 10,000 trucks and land trucks, while so far only about 1,600 vehicles have come to pay taxes and deposit.
