(Phnom Penh): As a Senior Official of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Senior Minister Kun Kim, First Vice President of the National Committee for Disaster Management, expressed his great pleasure and pride on the occasion of Cambodia hosting the event. The 13th Asia-Europe Summit just ended on November 26, 2021 yesterday.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen's Staff on Disaster Work and Veterans Kun Kim considered the international meeting chaired by Samdech Techo Hun Sen and concluded successfully as a source of pride for the whole Cambodian nation. To make Cambodia's reputation more famous on the international stage as well.
The Asia-Europe Forum, which is made up of 51 countries in Asia and Europe and two regional organizations (EU and ASEAN), is a forum for dialogue between Asia and Europe for economic growth and problem solving. Between the two regions. Cambodia became a member of this forum in 2004 and only in 2021 did Cambodia trust this forum to host, organize and lead this meeting.
As the host of the meeting, Cambodia has prepared a lot of qualifications, including technical resources, budget and human resources. The summit, chaired by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, was held on November 25 and 26, 2021, with the participation of the President, Prime Minister, senior officials of 51 member countries of Asia and Europe, as well as leaders. The European Union, as well as the ASEAN Secretariat.
As the host country, Cambodia has decided to make "strengthening multilateralism for common growth" a common theme in the two-day talks. The theme of the meeting, which was launched by Cambodia, was welcomed and appreciated by the leaders of the member countries as a chair, effectively responding to current regional and global issues.
Significant Asia-Europe Summit concludes on 26 November 2021 with the adoption of three key documents, including: Statement of the 13th ASEM Summit Chair, Urban Statement Phnom Penh on Socio-Economic Rehabilitation after the Kovid-19 Crisis and Future Action Document on ASEM Connectivity.
At the end of the meeting, the leaders who attended the meeting and the representatives of the European Union expressed their appreciation and appreciation to Samdech Techo Hun Sen and all his colleagues who worked hard to organize this meeting successfully, despite Context of the Kovid Outbreak 19.
Senior Minister Kun Kim, First Vice-Chairman of the National Committee for Disaster Management, told Fresh News that Cambodia, a country that has been harassed and destroyed by the fires of war in the past, is very proud of its credibility. Organize a summit that represents the world's 4 billion people.
"The reason we are allowed to host this meeting is to evaluate and evaluate our qualifications in detail on the economic situation, human resources and other relevant resources," he said. In particular, they believed in the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen that can lead and organize this meeting successfully.
Senior Minister Kun Kim also considered Cambodia's hosting of the meeting as an opportunity to promote and demonstrate capabilities for regional and international affairs, and the event also pushed Cambodia's reputation to the forefront. International as well.
At the same time, the Senior Minister called the organization of the Asia-Europe Summit a new historical event for Cambodia. This event also clearly shows that the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the head of the Royal Government and the President of the Cambodian People's Party is really strong and has really made Cambodia grow, have a better reputation and make the international Recognized from Cambodia as well.
