On that occasion, Mr. Sou Socheat, on behalf of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia, expressed his congratulations to Golden Fortune Dividex Exclusive Co., Ltd. An operator that provides exchange platforms for derivatives.
At the same time, Mr. Sou Socheat said that the trading platform for derivatives in Cambodia started in 2016 and in 2017 the market size was close to 5 million dollars, but by 2019 it has reached close to 500 million dollars. In 2020, due to the Kovid-19, it will decrease slightly, but it will be close to $ 400 million.
In addition, Mr. Sou Socheat believes that in 2021, the size of the derivatives market in Cambodia will not differ from what was achieved in 2020, between $ 400 million to $ 500 million. Years.
Senior Minister Kun Kim congratulates General Chea Dara, a former colleague on the border battlefield, on the occasion of the King's appointment as an advisor to Samdech Techo
Especially in the border war with Thailand in 2008, General Chea Dara was a front line commander who was constantly stationed in the hot battle direction of the Temple of Preah Vihear, waiting to respect and implement the orders of Samdech Techo Hun Sen in defeating the enemy, defending the territory, defending the nation and the Khmer temple.
The courage and heroic example of General Chea Dara is left in the respect, love and remembrance of the commanders, officers, deputies and soldiers who joined the battle to defend the motherland.
General Kun Kim, the chief of General Chea Dara, recalled and presented many heroic examples of General Chea Dara.
General Kun Kim thanked Samdech Techo Hun Sen for addressing the King for the appointment and conferment of General Chea Dara on his current position. The Senior Minister considered that the acquisition of the position and status of General Chea Dara is a great honor for General Chea Dara, an officer who has sacrificed his most sincere intellect and physical strength to the motherland.
Senior Minister Kun Kim also expressed his love and respect for General Chea Dara, especially remembering the bitter memories and many struggles on the battlefield together. Senior Minister Kun Kim wished General Chea Dara success in his role and duties and achieved new achievements in his duties for the benefit of the nation and the people under the leadership of strong man Samdech Techo Hun Sen. .
