(Phnom Penh): A man who insulted a traffic police officer while enforcing the law was arrested by the Phnom Penh Municipal Police at more than 1 noon on November 26, 2021 at the traffic light in Doeum Kor market in Khan Toul Kork while he was traveling on the road.
