National Committee for the Promotion of One Village, One Product Movement joins hands with Vireak Buntham Transport Company to promote local products
(Phnom Penh): In order to promote local products by facilitating the transportation of goods of the One Village One Product movement, the cooperation agreement between the General Secretariat of the National Committee for the Promotion of One Village One Product Movement and Vireak Buntham Transport Company Held on the afternoon of November 25, 2021. This is according to a press release obtained by Fresh News on November 26.
The main objectives of this initiative are as follows:
1: Improve the quality of local products, both handicrafts, agriculture and services in the context of one village, one product to meet the needs of domestic and foreign markets.
2: Promoting cooperation between public institutions (National Committee for the Promotion of One Village, One Product Movement), the private sector (Vireak Buntham Transport Company) and the association or community of producers of Khmer products.
3: Promote One Village, One Product product through the use of Vireak Buntham Transport Company to pack and deliver to meet the needs of customers in a timely manner and reduce shipping costs for One Village One Product
4: Encourage producers to sell directly to customers through the online market, with the convenience of delivering goods to consumers through the company Virak Buntham as a partner and provide special delivery fees to members of the village movement. All of the National Committee promotes one village, one production throughout the country.
