US company signs agreement to buy turmeric from Cambodia for export to Russia for the first time
The agreement to export Khmer mango and turmeric was made on November 22, 2021. In the first year, the two companies plan to export 2,000 tons of mangoes to Russia from December 2021 onwards, and will increase next year if exports run smoothly.
