"This memorandum shows the confidence of foreign companies in Cambodia's agricultural products, as well as our company, which has experience in exporting mangoes to markets such as China, Japan and Singapore," he said. "Thailand, Vietnam and Malaysia."
Van Rithy hopes the agreement will pave the way for Cambodia's mango to enter the European market.
"If exports to the Russian market are successful, Angkor Green and its partners will increase export volumes and also study the feasibility of exporting other agricultural products to boost supply in the Russian market and increase market opportunities as a whole," he said. More for our farmers as well. ”
