(Battambang): Senior Minister Kun Kim, Vice President and Secretary General of the Cambodian Veterans Association, on behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and President of the Cambodian Veterans Association, urged all relevant authorities to continue to pay attention to their livelihood. And the lives of veterans.
