After the National Assembly President Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin announced the results, the National Assembly Committee on Economy, Finance, Banking and Auditing and the National Assembly Committee on Foreign Affairs, International Cooperation, Propaganda and Information convened their respective election committees. Appoint a new Chairman, Vice Chairman and Secretary with the following results:
