At Techo Sen University in Kampong Thom, two three-story buildings, Building A and Building C, are fenced, with a pond, a dormitory (student accommodation), and other infrastructure. These constructions cover a total area of 20 hectares, with the first phase implementing a two-year project from June 2020 to June 2022. The project is also being implemented by Ly Chhuong Construction Import Export.
Sambo Prei Kuk National Authority said that the above three construction projects are funded at the sub-national level.
While the construction company is carrying out the work, on November 24, 2021, Ms. Phoeung Sakona, Minister of Culture and Fine Arts, together with Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Governor of Kampong Thom Province, inspected and evaluated the construction of the three main sites. During the inspection, the Minister urged the working group of Sambor Prei Kuk National Authority and the construction company to adhere to the quality in accordance with the agreed contract.
