Mr. Leang Ou said that the current landlord had already been notified twice to leave voluntarily. However, the tenants of the business location, such as car repair shop, Chab Houy shop, have not been notified yet, so the Ratanakkiri Provincial Court allowed them to dismantle and leave on their own for a while.
The Deputy Prosecutor further stated that the force will come down to implement the final judgment of the Supreme Court later. If the landlord does not see the case and the landlord refuses to leave, the authorities will dismantle and if there is damage, the authorities are not responsible.
