The donation started in March 2021 as part of the "Cambodian Motivation" charity campaign to donate a large amount of Cambodian water and beverages to institutions, including hospitals, hospitals, the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training, and the Inspectorate. The 14 district police in Phnom Penh and many other institutions.
