Kandal Provincial Administration will temporarily close all types of vehicles on Road 70A from Roka Kong Market to the base of the bridge in front of Wat Chreung in Peam Village, Roka Kong I Commune, Muk Kampoul District.
(Kandal): Kandal Provincial Administration has issued a temporary closure notice for all types of vehicles on Road 70A from Roka Kong Market to the base of the bridge in front of Wat Chreung in Peam Village, Roka Kong I Commune, Muk Kampoul District, Kandal Province. .
The Provincial Administration stated that "In order to avoid eventual accidents, the Kandal Provincial Administration will temporarily close the section of Road 70A from Roka Kong Market to the base of the bridge in front of Wat Chreung in Peam Village, Roka Kong I Commune, Muk Kampoul District from the date of notification." This is until the construction of the river bank and repair of the road above is completed.
Therefore, all residents who live and travel through the above location, please understand and tolerate by diverting traffic from the base of the bridge in front of Wat Chreung to Street 260 up to Lok Ta Ko He Street in Prek Pdao Village, Roka Kong I Commune, District Top of Kandal province.
