(Kandal): During the three days of the Royal Water Festival, Ok Ambok, floating lanterns and worshiping the moon in Takhmao City, Kandal Province, it was observed that the Takhmao City Police Force led by Inspector Yi Vanda patrolled and provided security. Good order in the city without any crime and well organized.
