Regarding the distribution of donations to these people, according to Mr. Phok Savuth, Governor of Kang Meas District, since the February 20 community event, Kang Meas District has been severely affected by the spread of Kovid 19 disease, which people have Fear of not daring to go out to do business that affects daily life.
On that occasion, the people expressed their deep gratitude to Deputy Prime Minister Hor Namhong, a senior official of the Royal Government of Cambodia of the Cambodian People's Party, for giving them timely gifts.
