The National Technical and Vocational Education and Training system, remotely or online, has the following purposes and objectives:
1: Provide continuous and flexible technical and vocational training opportunities during the outbreak of Kovid-19 and after the Kovid-19 crisis.
2. Increase access to equitable technical and vocational training programs among young people throughout Cambodia.
3: Improving the curriculum for distance or online training.
