Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants to establish an agreement on border agriculture between Cambodia and Vietnam (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen told Vietnamese Ambassador to Cambodia Nguyen Huy Taing that Cambodia and Vietnam There should be an agreement on cooperation on border agriculture between the two countries.
