In addition to encouraging trade, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed a desire to see an agreement on agriculture on the border between Cambodia and Vietnam.
The cooperation that Samdech Techo wants is the supply of raw materials, the development and supply of seeds, the use of water along the border, the fight against pests.
