According to the announcement of the Ministry of Education, the management of educational institutions must prepare for the second semester exam before the end of the school year. The management of the educational institution shall hold a meeting to summarize the results of the end of the school year after December 18 and before the start of the new school year.
School management, teachers must start the enrollment campaign for children at least 6 years old or 70 months old (as of January 10, 2022) and children who drop out due to the impact of Kovid-19 from the date of this announcement under the cooperation and support of the Board of Education, Local Authorities, Communities, Parents, Guardians.
The school management, the teacher in charge of the class must prepare the list of students to be promoted, to drop out of school, to transfer students for the new school year from December 13 onwards.
