(Phnom Penh): The close relationship between Cambodia and China has brought great achievements for the Cambodian nation and people. The new achievement from this Cambodia-China friendship is the "Cambodia-China Stung Trang-Krouch Chhmar Friendship Bridge", a bridge across the Mekong River connecting Stung Trang district, Kampong Cham province and Krouch Chhmar district, Tbong Khmum province, worth nearly 57 million US dollars.
The new historical achievement in Stung Trang district and the wedge under the shadow of peace was officially inaugurated this morning, Tuesday, November 23, 2021, under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Mr. Wang Vin Thien Ek. Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia
In addition to the inauguration of the bridge across the Mekong River, in tomorrow's program also connected with the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of National Road "71C (C)" connecting Tbong district, Tbong Khmum province to Chamkar Leu district, Kampong Cham province, length 115 kilometers as well.
This road starts at km 154 + 700, National Road 7 is located in Sralop commune, Tbong Khmum district, Tbong Khmum province and ends at km 30 + 400, National Road No. 71 is located in Svay Teap commune, Chamkar Leu district, Kampong Cham province.
The 42-month road will be built by Shanghai Construction Company (SCG) and technically inspected by Guangzhou Wanan Technical Consulting, which is expected to cost nearly $ 130 million.
He added that this new achievement is an invaluable commitment of the Royal Government of Cambodia to the people of Kampong Cham and Tbong Khmum, as well as people across the country for general and long-term use under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the General Leader and a win-win political operator who brought peace to the motherland of Cambodia.
China has become a country that has actively supported the construction of infrastructure in Cambodia, including roads and bridges. To date, 29 road infrastructure projects using Chinese concessional financing and grants have been built, with a total length of more than 3,000 kilometers, with a budget of nearly 2 billion US dollars. The project is under construction with 3 lines with a length of nearly 364 km, with a budget of nearly 530 million US dollars.
Separately, 9 major bridges have been completed, with a total length of more than 8.5 km, using a budget of more than 290 million US dollars, and 1 bridge under construction with a total length of 996 meters, the bridge across the Bassac Sitbo River of the ring road project. Third, spend more than 56 million US dollars. The total number of projects funded by concessions and grants from Chinese friends that have been completed and under construction is more than 2.871 million US dollars.
