The three-year rolling investment program integration workshop was held to promote the 2022 priority investment projects of Khan administrations and 2022 priority investment projects of 11 Sangkat administrations, requesting project support from specialized departments, development organizations, private sector partners. And philanthropists to support Khan and Sangkat projects.
In the integration workshop in 2021, a total of 128 projects were supported, 73 projects were implemented, equal to 59%, including: 14 economic projects, 35 social projects, natural resources, environment and climate change. 05 projects for administration and security of public order, 19 projects.
The projects to be submitted for support in the current integration workshop in 2022 include: 112 priority projects of the district, 29 economic projects, 40 social projects, 40 projects in natural resources, environment and climate change. 22 projects in the field of administration and security of public order, 21 projects, priority activities projects of the 11 communes, a total of 402 projects, including:
27 business projects, 29 education projects, 72 health projects, 42 km of vulnerable sectors, 54 environmental projects, 178 administrative and security projects.
